#: includes/class-docs.php:106
msgid "Displays a responsive grid of events. Past events are hidden by default and more events load as the visitor scrolls. All attributes are optional and default to your settings on Events → Settings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:108
msgid "How many events to show initially (1–50)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:109
msgid "Limit to one category by its slug. Empty shows all."
