#: includes/class-docs.php:136
msgid "Single element shortcodes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:137
msgid "Render one piece of an event — handy for custom layouts. Inside an event (single page or loop) they use the current event automatically; elsewhere, pass an \"id\" attribute to target a specific event. All of them also accept \"class\", \"before\", and \"after\"."
